# BRAVADO: FIREWALKERS let Dice wade into one lava pool a fight (two at the
# second tier): the pool cools to rock. ROCKET DASH: tap fire twice on the
# move and she dashes that way, safe, over lava, flattening any monster in a
# wide lane; B is still a bomb at once. That is TV Tropes' reading; the
# wiki's (B twice) is kept behind a test cheat.
game bravado
wait 5
cheat run 1
cheat gear 10 1
cheat fight
cheat empty
cheat nopools
cheat pool 200 94
cheat pool 260 94
expect pools == 2
expect p1_walks == 1
hold RIGHT 35
expect pools == 1
expect p1_walks == 0
expect p1_hp == 6
hold RIGHT 60
expect p1_hp < 6
# the dash: fire tapped twice on the move; it sweeps a wide lane
cheat run 1
cheat gear 11 1
cheat fight
cheat empty
cheat nopools
cheat still 0 171 48
cheat still 4 160 40
cheat pool 160 70
hold UP
press A
press A
release
expect p1_dash > 0
expect bombs_out == 0
wait 20
expect foes == 0
expect kills == 2
expect p1_hp == 6
expect p1_y < 50
expect p1_dashes == 1
# standing still, a double tap is just two shots
wait 30
press A
press A
expect p1_dashes == 1
# B is a bomb at once, dash or no dash
press B
expect bombs_out == 1
# a keg flattened mid-dash: its blast lingers and catches her as the dash ends
cheat run 1
cheat gear 11 1
cheat fight
cheat empty
cheat nopools
wait 31
cheat still 3 160 40
hold UP
press A
press A
release
wait 30
expect p1_down == 1
expect hurt_src == 300
# the wiki's reading, kept for the tests: B twice (the first an ordinary bomb)
cheat run 1
cheat gear 11 1
cheat fight
cheat empty
cheat nopools
cheat dashreading 1
press B
expect bombs_out == 1
press B
expect p1_dashes == 1
cheat dashreading 0
